{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you hands-on access to the core gameplay of <i><strong>Ego League</strong></i>, a skill-based, competitive football game where you control a single player on the field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s included in the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer matches (up to 7v7 online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to 4 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard/mouse support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Limitations:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only one arena and a subset of abilities from the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No progression, ranked mode, or private lobbies yet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early test build (expect bugs and limited polish)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No controller support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shooting (<i>Kicks, Headers, Bicycle-Kicks</i>)</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All forms of shooting are charged with left click. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flick vertically for height, horizontally for curve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.poster.avif?t=1752897432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.webm?t=1752897432\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.mp4?t=1752897432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dribbling</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you hold, the more power you put into each touch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the ball with precision or risk being overwhelmed by opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.poster.avif?t=1752897432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.webm?t=1752897432\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.mp4?t=1752897432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trapping (receiving passes)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use middle click to absorb incoming passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time it right and you gain control. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcharge and you risk losing momentum, giving your opponent the chance to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.poster.avif?t=1752897432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.webm?t=1752897432\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876000/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.mp4?t=1752897432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOTE: Gameplay footage shown is from early development and is highly subject to change.</p>","backgro